      "description": "Careers at DSU - Dakota State University Skip navigation Dakota State University Toggle Menu Request Info Visit DSU Apply Fill 1 Give a Gift About Academics Research Admissions Student Life Athletics Trojan Net Careers at DSU Alumni & Friends Office of the President DSU Cyber 27 Government & Corporate Partners Directory Events News Rise with us DSU is a place where innovation meets opportunity. We are a nationally recognized leader in technology-driven education, constantly pushing the boundaries of whatâs possible. With hands-on learning experiences, expert faculty, and cutting-edge facilities, we prepare you for modern careers. Choose from a wide range of affordable, forward-thinking programs that allow you to shape your own path. Your future begins today. Majors & Degrees Toggle Search Request Info Visit DSU Apply Fill 1 Give a Gift Search Popular searches Commencement Majors & Degrees Academic Calendar Tuition and Fees Online Programs Karl E. Mundt Library Map Apply Scholarships Directory Housing Rise with us DSU is a place where innovation meets opportunity. We are a nationally recognized leader in technology-driven education, constantly pushing the boundaries of whatâs possible. With hands-on learning experiences, expert faculty, and cutting-edge facilities, we prepare you for modern careers. Choose from a wide range of affordable, forward-thinking programs that allow you to shape your own path. Your future begins today. Visit DSU Request Info Visit DSU Apply Fill 1 Give a Gift Close Alert Dakota State University Home ― Careers at DSU Careers at DSU Watch Video At DSU, you will join a dynamic community of passionate educators and support staff who impact our students' lives and the community. Together we are Trojan True, and we are looking for talented individuals to join our team. Questions about a career at DSU? Call (605) 291-5554 or email. open positions In this Section Search Employment Opportunities Employment Benefits Experience Madison Strategic Plan Accreditations Fact Sheet Policies Disability Accommodations Student Employment True Trojan Nominations Employment benefits Be a Trojan Dakota State benefit-eligible employees receive a comprehensive and flexible package including paid time off, health and retirement benefits, and life and disability insurance options. Benefits Building a foundation Maintain a lifelong connection with alumni and friends. Get involved with alumni chapters, watch parties, service opportunities, and alumni events. Trojans Unite! Traditions Traditions play a unique role in the culture at DSU. Traditions focus on the history of Dakota State, provide a means of building community, instill common values which span generations of faculty, staff and student and generate pride and enthusiasm. At DSU, we value our people and find every opportunity to celebrate. True Trojans At Dakota State University, we’re proud to be Trojans. Whether you’re a part of the DSU community or just a visitor, we make sure you have what you need to succeed. With more than 45 undergraduate majors and several graduate degrees, we’re not just reimagining education—we’re providing more opportunities for students to realize their potential. Explore the Madison Community Dakota State is in the heart of Madison, South Dakota . It's the seat of Lake County, which is home to a number of scenic lakes, hiking trails, two state parks, and miles of rolling prairie. Learn about the Madison Community Strategic Plan 2027 The ADVANCE strategic plan began in 2022 and will continue to evolve through 2027 and beyond. We will consider our strengths and challenges as we bring stakeholders together to move our University forward. Our strategy focuses on quality, research, engagement, athletics, and student success. Read the Strategic Plan University Fact Sheet We are pleased to present the newest edition of Dakota State University’s Fact Sheet. The Fact Sheet provides a convenient source of information on the many aspects of DSU. It provides general information about some of our basic data points. Get the facts 1881 Founded as a Teacher's College 50%+ Programs Offered Online $137.4M Statewide Economic Impact Madison School District The Madison School District is renowned for its exceptional commitment to providing a quality education, setting the standard for excellence in academic achievement, character development, and inclusive learning environments. With a team of highly qualified educators, state-of-the-art facilities, and a comprehensive curriculum, the district ensures that each student receives a well-rounded education, tailored to their individual needs and interests. Madison School District Madison School District Government Report Card Experience Sioux Falls Sioux Falls has become one of the must-see cities in the Midwest, and for good reason. No matter your hobbies, budget, or travel style, Sioux Falls has a unique experience waiting for you, year-round. Sioux Falls Visitor Guide Madison, small town feel, big-city amenities Madison’s quality of life is what many believe is their greatest asset. From parks and recreation to a strong education system, and top-notch healthcare, the city’s sign encourages everyone coming into town to, “Discover the Unexpected.” Watch the Video Events @ DSU There's always something happening on campus at Dakota State University. From Trojan Days, to concerts, athletic events and more. Get involved at DSU. DSU Public Calendar Meet the team Alicia Entringer Human Resources Manager Heidi Hausmann Graduate Enrollment Counselor Kandy Lurz HR Generalist II Dakota State University 888.DSU.9988 820 N Washington Ave. Madison, SD 57042 Contact Us facebook twitter instagram linkedin youtube News Events Give a Gift Directory Library Bookstore Careers at DSU Support Desk Office of the President Alumni & Friends Media Relations Government & Corporate Partners Campus Map Consumer Information DSU Cyber 27 Trojan Net © 2026 Dakota State University Concerns & Feedback Accessibility Privacy Policies Title IX"
